{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1458174-the-google-docpocalypse","id":1458174,"title":"The Google Docpocalypse","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-31T13:53:56-07:00","id":1458174,"title":"The Google Docpocalypse","content":"On September 13th there will be a security update to Google Drive that will change many of the url links on forums and discord etc. This has the potential to lose some of the more extensive fan content that people have made in the last few years if the original creator is no-longer an active participant in the community. <br /> <br /> I intend to going to revisit this on the 14th with some links to where useful content has been re-hosted. <br /> <br /> Thank you for your time. Hopefully the title proves to be an exaggeration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-01T11:41:39-07:00","id":1458243,"title":"","content":"So as someone who has tools and resources that I have built in Google docs and sheets and want to keep them available, do I need to reshare links after they are changed by Google or some other step in the meantime?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-01T16:33:51-07:00","id":1458269,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the new thread Lioness.<br /> <br /> <br /> Yes, please share all the new urls for anything you don't want to purposely bury. If everyone shares on this thread here, then it'll double as an Ultimate Homebrew Hub. Er, actually maybe that should go in a new thread with a better name.<br /> <br /> I am also on a mission to download ALL the google docs with Exalted material, because Google is weird and dumb and incompatible with the Wayback Machine, so I can't just save the docs online. I would like to just upload them all to my own Google Drive for sharing, but obviously I don't have permission from anybody who made these things. So... I will be preserving as many as possible, but not sure about an appropriate way to make them available again. Actually I already have a ton of other peoples' stuff on my Google Drive, and don't even know who made a lot of them because not everybody signs their work. &gt;.&lt;<br /> <br /> I'd really like suggestions for how to handle this, actually. I'm assuming that not every single person will share the new links. For example, when I asked Maudova for permission to access their Fivefold Dragon Paths they didn't even remember they had that online.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 09-01-2021, 07:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-01T20:55:19-07:00","id":1458296,"title":"","content":"Question. I have several urls of google docs of homebrew from other people. Are they going to work after this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-02T06:38:33-07:00","id":1458333,"titl